00:16:10.835 --> 00:16:13.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
so we can work with them
in a controlled environment.

00:16:13.505 --> 00:16:15.741
JUSTIN: Hey, hey, hey.

00:16:15.741 --> 00:16:17.075
Calm down.

00:16:17.075 --> 00:16:18.577
MATT: Coming in with Eisenhower.

00:16:18.577 --> 00:16:19.811 align:start size:81% position:19%
I'm starting to work
the presidents

00:16:19.811 --> 00:16:21.413
with my colleague, Stef.

00:16:21.413 --> 00:16:23.081 align:start size:84% position:16%
She's a super talented
dog trainer.

00:16:23.081 --> 00:16:26.351 align:start size:91% position:9%
And Caitlyn, our manager,
is providing backup.

00:16:26.351 --> 00:16:29.054 line:0%
I want to see Roosevelt and
Eisenhower together first

00:16:29.054 --> 00:16:30.489 align:start size:91% position:9%
since the owner said that
they're in the middle

00:16:30.489 --> 00:16:32.157 line:0%
of most of the fights.

00:16:32.157 --> 00:16:35.560
So I want to see for myself what
they do to trigger each other.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I create a safe boundary
between the two,

00:16:37.462 --> 00:16:40.298 align:start size:84% position:16%
