00:37:05.022 --> 00:37:06.490 align:start size:88% position:13%
So we'll just peek over
and then...

00:37:06.490 --> 00:37:07.825 align:start size:97% position:3%
JUSTIN: Perfect. Let's do it.
I'll follow you.

00:37:07.825 --> 00:37:08.926 line:0%
CAITLYN: Cool.

00:37:08.926 --> 00:37:10.761 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
MATT: I'm gonna start
with Eisenhower and Truman.

00:37:10.761 --> 00:37:12.929 line:0%
STEF: Come on, bubs.

00:37:12.929 --> 00:37:15.766 line:0%
MATT: Ah, I got it
right in my mouth.

00:37:15.766 --> 00:37:19.269 align:start size:97% position:3%
We're now, like we're
spit brothers, you know that?

00:37:19.269 --> 00:37:20.337
STEF: Come on, nugget.

00:37:20.337 --> 00:37:21.772
MATT: Bring him in
if you would, please.

00:37:21.772 --> 00:37:24.308
STEF: Let's go, Truman.

00:37:24.308 --> 00:37:25.976
Good boy.

00:37:25.976 --> 00:37:27.377
MATT: Let's go for
a smell and see.

00:37:27.377 --> 00:37:28.478
STEF: Okay.

00:37:28.478 --> 00:37:30.981
I'm gonna go around this way.

00:37:30.981 --> 00:37:33.283 align:start size:88% position:13%
Oh, that's polite, bud,
that's very polite.

00:37:33.283 --> 00:37:35.786
MATT: There we go. One, two.

00:37:40.324 --> 00:37:41.124 line:0%
MATT: Let's go for
a smell and see.

00:37:41.124 --> 00:37:42.125 line:0%
STEF: Okay.

00:37:42.125 --> 00:37:43.060 align:start size:97% position:3%
MATT: Today we're integrating
bulldog brothers

00:37:43.060 --> 00:37:45.262
Eisenhower and Truman
for the first time

00:37:45.262 --> 00:37:47.331 align:start size:91% position:9% line:0%
before their owner Justin
takes them home.

00:37:47.331 --> 00:37:50.167
There we go. One, two.

00:37:51.936 --> 00:37:54.605
You would think that these dogs
have never done that in the home

00:37:54.605 --> 00:37:58.942
with each other, like never had
a healthy dog smell interaction.

00:37:58.942 --> 00:38:00.310
STEF: Mm-hmm.
MATT: Wow.

00:38:00.310 --> 00:38:01.712
STEF: Good job, Truman.

00:38:01.712 --> 00:38:03.247
MATT: Come here, my bud.

00:38:03.247 --> 00:38:04.514
Let's go smell him.

00:38:04.514 --> 00:38:07.051
Come on. There we go. One, two.

00:38:07.051 --> 00:38:09.486
There we go. There you go.

00:38:09.486 --> 00:38:10.287
(laughs)

00:38:10.287 --> 00:38:12.990
You did it! That a boy.

00:38:12.990 --> 00:38:15.091
That a boy! Good for you.

00:38:15.091 --> 00:38:17.494
Come here, come here, love bug.

00:38:17.494 --> 00:38:18.729
Hi, friend.

00:38:18.729 --> 00:38:19.996
There you go.

00:38:19.996 --> 00:38:21.131
STEF: Look at Truman going in.

00:38:21.131 --> 00:38:22.800
MATT: Good for you, Truman.

00:38:22.800 --> 00:38:23.868
There you go.

00:38:23.868 --> 00:38:25.669
Good for you, Eisenhower.

00:38:25.669 --> 00:38:28.005 align:start size:88% position:13%
They've not actually had
direct interaction.

00:38:28.005 --> 00:38:30.774 align:start position:0%
Truman couldn't do it and
Eisenhower couldn't be trusted.

00:38:30.774 --> 00:38:33.477
There's a lot of stuff in here
that wasn't happening before,

00:38:33.477 --> 00:38:34.644
that's really positive.

00:38:34.644 --> 00:38:35.479
STEF: That's good.

00:38:35.479 --> 00:38:37.748 align:start size:88% position:13%
MATT: Good boy, Truman.
You did great.

00:38:37.748 --> 00:38:39.350 align:start size:91% position:9%
Yeah, let's have Roosevelt
come in.

00:38:39.350 --> 00:38:41.051 align:start size:88% position:13%
STEF: So, Caitlyn,
you want to just step in

00:38:41.051 --> 00:38:42.919
